---
layout: base.njk
title: RiverTycoon — Gaming & DevLog
description: Pixel River Studio baut RiverTycoon — ein Indie Mobile Game für Android & iOS. DevLog mit allen Entwicklungs-Updates.
---

<div class="page-wrap">

  <a href="/" class="page-back">← zurück zum Studio</a>

  <div class="section-label">Indie Game Dev</div>
  <h1 class="page-h1">
    RiverTycoon
    <span style="color:var(--cyan);font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:400"> — Mobile Game</span>
  </h1>
  <p style="font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--text-2);max-width:520px;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem">
    Von broke Indie Dev zum Tech CEO. Grind Jobs, kauf Gear, bau dein Empire —
    in einer Welt voller iFoons, Samsong-Geräte und Damazon Crime-Lieferungen.
  </p>
  <div style="display:flex;gap:0.4rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:3rem">
    <span class="case-tag tag-wip" style="margin:0">In Development</span>
    <span class="tag-tech" style="padding:0.25rem 0.55rem">Unity 6</span>
    <span class="tag-tech" style="padding:0.25rem 0.55rem">Mobile</span>
    <span class="tag-tech" style="padding:0.25rem 0.55rem">Android & iOS</span>
  </div>

  <div class="section-label">DevLog</div>

  {% set posts = collections.devlog %}
  {% if posts and posts.length %}
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.75rem">
      {% for post in posts | reverse %}
      <article class="devlog-post">
        <time>{{ post.date | dateDisplay }}</time>
        <h3><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h3>
        {% if post.data.summary %}<p>{{ post.data.summary }}</p>{% endif %}
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  {% else %}
    <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-3)">DevLog-Einträge folgen in Kürze.</p>
  {% endif %}

</div>
